{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_title", "source_sha256": "bc8d6810f1ec116f59b4db71b48c6fc4dbb9e79ed25c95f9fcd7f38319de9424", "ja": "夢見る才能", "zh": "做梦的才能", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_synopsis", "source_sha256": "753985ebf6b9352c9427bcba40d6dccd2b93a8952cf1b318ab1e9f51566bdc93", "ja": "オーディションに落ち続け凹んでいる未来。\nライブ前のレッスンで、皆が大変そうだと\n振付の変更を提案する。だが朋花に、それは\n手加減だと注意される。未来は、挑戦する前\nから諦めていた、自分の誤りに気付く。", "zh": "试镜接连落选而备受打击的未来。\n在演唱会前的练习中，她觉得大家都很辛苦\n便提议修改动作。但朋花却提醒她，\n这是在放水。未来察觉到了自己的错误——\n自己在挑战之前就放弃了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_1000_null", "source_sha256": "fbf01bc45055c908c05ba6bda4777b9d9f53b76675c25862b9d8c1ae493e7b6c", "ja": "定期公演から数日後……", "zh": "定期公演几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "19bb2d595a25c39bbb0d3f33fcf30362f400bdd0da5ae6b141ff35dabb7ee5d2", "ja": "うう～ん……。ううううう～～ん……。", "zh": "唔唔～……。唔唔唔唔唔～～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f0b9c02104ce4c82ebdf31e19ffc7b9296206d4b1ec2fccc36e4882271fe2cd9", "ja": "お疲れさま……？\n未来、うなり声なんか上げて、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "辛苦了……？\n未来，你一直发出呻吟声，是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "d9f7f6a1775ec1c0f20adad946d3fc256a72fdad48aa233525fdeda7d1bf3bd6", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nえっとですね……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "195b9f71acf18dcdd08cfd41f06014670a90e1fdf07d50b96a47fcf3c077c61d", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　未来ちゃんは今、\n理想のアイドルについて悩んでるんですよ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！未来现在正在为理想的偶像而烦恼呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_1005_p", "source_sha256": "dde01ee42b179af91c88ca18f09e3eaf1727eb54fb472eea174c3d7125e573c0", "ja": "理想のアイドル？", "zh": "理想中的偶像？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "ba3a61bed3a547d71bd03ae3d9c4e9b074124ec5c761d7efe242a36dd14889fb", "ja": "あっ、それそれ♪　今日はみんなで、\n自分の理想のアイドルを描くんですよ！", "zh": "啊，对对♪ 今天要大家一起画出\n自己理想中的偶像哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "efe2c5d2dc124aac8b8636d2e5054f80963223009b2b8901bfb71e0ba625a360", "ja": "ロコちゃんが、提案してくれたんです。\n「アートは、心を形にすることですからね！」って。", "zh": "是ROCO提议的。\n“艺术就是将心灵化为具体形态，对吧！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1118548ea87540b07b503a4142aff9e83d91e92920975e714bf3691f61505009", "ja": "なるほど、理想のアイドル……けど、なかなか\n難しそうなテーマですね。ひとつに絞れるかどうか……", "zh": "原来如此，理想的偶像……不过，这个主题似乎相当难啊。能不能限定为一个呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "227bf421f9e1ea8c21cbe480c5dc5b8b6fd0ae3abe46f5e3b037798923f561f1", "ja": "そうなんです～っ！　ありさ的には、\n王道スタンダードも捨てがたいんですケド……！", "zh": "就是这样～！对亚利沙来说，\n经典王道路线也很难割舍呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_1010_010azu", "source_sha256": "3e1ca2c85159730448b954817025ebfb4d3f8c6419ced0ca0fbe54c3b339ffc2", "ja": "私も、迷ってしまって。\n可愛いも、カッコイイも素敵ですし……。", "zh": "我也有点举棋不定。可爱也好，帅气也好，都很棒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "5a4778d572a3ac778b988f4c84ac7e7eb223323703e57eda398261740723e5b8", "ja": "真ちゃんみたいに、両立できたらいいんだけど～。", "zh": "要是也能像真那样兼顾两者就好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "335ebb1ac0cef35e950db336c36f0629c0d84618b9d2c1118986b3db50e9b7cb", "ja": "やはりここは、目指すしかないのでは……。\nアイドルの中のアイドル、究極のアイドル……。", "zh": "果然，看来只能以此为目标了吧……  \n偶像中的偶像，究极的偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "35d4eb97fbeb2c5edcd9c85bdfd21f5c0b8efadd7063a8a79e331d2adc4dcd62", "ja": "ジ・アイドルオブアイドルを！", "zh": "终极偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ef335d572531eb1d30210bef985b43166604a3f6d41a8966d1ed67c96d356347", "ja": "ジ・アイドルオブアイドル……！", "zh": "偶像中的偶像……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "623e4a5943c6f5779cf6533d7d3a62ab3d6da5cfb7ba73f893dc2897126c18e8", "ja": "なんか、カッコイイかも～！", "zh": "总觉得，好像挺帅的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_1016_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "c8668975dd6e2b9365b7824a502d3efac22b65ac9a1b66a6eef6f157bc6b8e64", "ja": "お疲れさまです～。\nみんな、もう集まっていたんですね！", "zh": "辛苦了～。\n大家已经都到了啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "4c8e21d933ca326ca89a67926a53d3217d45d1786577d6d48d00a9cb3736d13f", "ja": "あっ、ロコちゃん！　うん、言われたとおり、\n絵にしようと思って、いろいろ描いてるんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，ROCO！嗯，我按你说的，想着把它画下来，画了好多东西，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "fe972516d744461dac510913791d5dffe56aa88fdc0b30af5799950e76904a70", "ja": "描きたいことがいっぱいあって、\nぜんぜん、ひとつにまとまらないんだよ～。", "zh": "想画的东西太多了，完全没法集中到一个上面嘛～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "5de8ae6fd3d5560845ff347cf1ea58c708204c9c9cb1e4a98285c1180177aa03", "ja": "ミライのハートは、アグレッシブですね！\nだったら、それを全部描けばいいと思いますよ！", "zh": "未来的想法很有冲劲呢！既然这样，我觉得把它们全部画出来就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_1021_025roc", "source_sha256": "db93cd3188187a56e53883c51e9ef4ac533559ae742787ba94dbb762293bbcca", "ja": "何しろ、アートはフリーダムですから！", "zh": "毕竟，艺术就是自由嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_1022_031tom", "source_sha256": "efa23512e59ae72b42b35447ea90c964a95a66465d3f2e14db2a323af119da7f", "ja": "アートは自由……そうですね～。\nなら私たちも、心のままに描きましょうか～？", "zh": "艺术是自由的……确实如此呢～。\n那我们也随心所欲地画吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "b06263b764c469bc03eeba3e27d8671fd578604b37e819d6782af0ff062986fe", "ja": "そっかぁ……よーしっ！\nたくさん描くぞ～っ！", "zh": "这样啊……好——！\n我要画好多好多～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_116_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "3ac0050d5e9137ac921d82f3947651c2a8303063e88c37143bb7a646f8a03dee", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\n私のアート、できたら見てくださいね♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n等我的艺术作品画好了，请一定要看哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
